good:       ok
mismatch:   line 2, column 7: </a> closes <b>
two roots:  line 1, column 5: a document may hold only one root element, and <b> is a second
bad entity: line 1, column 4: the entity "&nope;" is not declared
raw amp:    line 1, column 9: an entity reference has no closing semicolon
quick check: true false
escaped text: salt &amp; pepper
